  ($t$LAW25.3.4-L0-9$t$, $t$Privacy Impact Assessments$t$, $t$PIA$t$, $t$LAW25.3.4$t$, $t$Are the protection measures suggested by the person in charge at any stage of a project (for example a steering committee, protection clauses in contracts, staff training) considered and recorded?$t$, $t$Act respecting the protection of personal information in the private sector (CQLR c. P-39.1), s. 3.4$t$, 9),
