  ($t$LAW25.3.5.2-L0-11$t$, $t$Confidentiality Incidents$t$, $t$INC$t$, $t$LAW25.3.5.2$t$, $t$Where an incident presents a risk of serious injury, does the organization promptly notify the Commission d'accès à l'information and every person whose personal information is concerned?$t$, $t$Act respecting the protection of personal information in the private sector (CQLR c. P-39.1), s. 3.5$t$, 11),
  ($t$LAW25.3.6-L0-12$t$, $t$Confidentiality Incidents$t$, $t$INC$t$, $t$LAW25.3.6$t$, $t$Does the organization's incident definition cover unauthorized access, unauthorized use, unauthorized communication, loss, and any other breach of the protection of personal information?$t$, $t$Act respecting the protection of personal information in the private sector (CQLR c. P-39.1), s. 3.6$t$, 12),
