  ($t$LAW25.27.1-L0-49$t$, $t$Individual Rights$t$, $t$RGT$t$, $t$LAW25.27.1$t$, $t$On request, does the organization confirm the existence of personal information it holds about a person, communicate it, and allow the person to obtain a copy?$t$, $t$Act respecting the protection of personal information in the private sector (CQLR c. P-39.1), s. 27$t$, 49),
